%F A026914 D-finite with recurrence: (4 + 4*n)*a(n) + 2*a(n + 1) + (-3 - n)*a(n + 2) + (108 + 12*n)*a(n + 4) + 6*a(5 + n) + (-33 - 3*n)*a(n + 6) + 216*n + 1512 = 0. (End)
